  "description": "Dasle leads such a busy life that she barely has time to enjoy herself.\n\nThinking that everyone deserves a little happiness in life, her friend gives her a boyfriend as a gift.\n\nAn electronic boyfriend, that is.\n\nBut Dasle is so busy that she doesn't even have time to take her new boyfriend out of the box.\n\nTired of waiting, her Naughty Boyfriend takes matters into his own hands and starts doing the housework for her.\n\nBut here's the problem...\n\nAlong with a spotless home, she starts having naughty dreams, too.\n\nOr wait... is that really a problem?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002954)",
